# Foretelling a card and suspending one are special actions (CR 116.2h, 702.143b; CR 116.2f, 702.62a), not activated
# abilities (CR 602.1), so Sorcerous Spyglass's "activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated"
# (CR 602.5) does not stop them. On turn 2 Bot2 casts three Spyglasses, looks at Bot1's hand and names Delayed Blast
# Fireball, Lotus Bloom and Miscalculation. On turn 3 Bot1, with four mana available, is refused Miscalculation's cycling
# (an activated ability of a named card, still stopped), then suspends Lotus Bloom and foretells Delayed Blast Fireball.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Delayed Blast Fireball
Miscalculation
Lotus Bloom
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Sorcerous Spyglass
Sorcerous Spyglass
Sorcerous Spyglass
Island x10

[Actions]
